<h2>About the studio</h2>
<p>DigiRune Studios is Will McCullough, working alone out of Beaufort, South Carolina. The studio builds official
companion apps for independent tabletop publishers and standalone tools for the wider tabletop community.
Sheetmancer exists because retyping a paper character sheet into a computer is miserable. It is a standalone
app with no subscription: it reads the sheet you already own, whatever game it came from.</p>

